{
  "description": "Gate S.2b golden vectors for society payroll (fictional amounts, PKR as decimal strings). Proration is calendar days rounded half up to the paisa (a labelled demo rule). No deduction is ever applied: statutory deductions are placeholders, unpaid leave holds the line, absences are reported only, and advance or loan instalments are held because the advance's payment to the employee is not verified. An instruction never pays anything and nothing is ever settled.",
